description:
**This app is only available in Arabic.**

Thakir Prayer Times is a desktop application to calculate prayer times for Algeria cities and author in the World:

• Accurate Prayer time calculator based on your current location;

• With Azan/Adhan: visual and audio notifications/calls for prayer;

• Quibla direction;

• Enable/Disable Alert before Adhan;

• Enable/Disable autostart in login;

• Arabic GUI;
